
  THE TETRAHEDRON ALGORITHM FOR H(T)

======================================================================

  Products: 30 = 2*3*5, 36 = 2*3*6, 42 = 2*3*7
  Arithmetic progression: 30, 36, 42 (step 6 = 2*3)
  30 + 42 = 72 = 2 * 36 (the pivot is the midpoint!)

